"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"}}}